{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "faraday",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**法拉第电磁感应定律**\n---\n$$\n\\mathcal{E} = -\\frac{d\\Phi}{dt}\n$$",
			"x": 50,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "motional",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**动生电动势**\n---\n$$\n\\mathcal{E} = \\int (\\vec{v} \\times \\vec{B}) \\cdot d\\vec{l}\n$$",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "induced",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**感生电动势**\n---\n$$\n\\nabla \\times \\vec{E} = -\\frac{\\partial \\vec{B}}{\\partial t}\n$$",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "self",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**自感**\n---\n$$\n\\mathcal{E}_L = -L \\frac{dI}{dt}\n$$",
			"x": 1050,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 150
		},
		{
			"id": "mutual",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**互感**\n---\n$$\n\\mathcal{E}_2 = -M \\frac{dI_1}{dt}\n$$",
			"x": 1050,
			"y": 280,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 150
		},
		{
			"id": "energy",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁场的能量**\n---\n$$\nW = \\frac{1}{2}LI^2\n$$",
			"x": 1050,
			"y": 540,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 150
		},
		{
			"id": "edist",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**感生电场的分布**\n---\n圆形/矩形磁场下的涡旋电场分布",
			"x": 150,
			"y": 580,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "disp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**位移电流**\n---\n$$\nI_d = \\varepsilon_0 \\frac{d\\Phi_E}{dt}\n$$\n连接电磁感应与麦克斯韦方程组",
			"x": 80,
			"y": 810,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 170
		}
	],
